{
  "slug": "claude-code-kit",
  "name": "Claude Code Kit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn any task into production-ready code. Specialized agents automatically handle planning, implementation, code review, and security scanning for any stack.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **4 agents** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `agent-creator` (Create Claude Code sub-agents with optimal configuration), `agent-teams` (Large-scale parallel work guidance), `auto-dev` (Automated development pipeline), `brainstorming` (Design and spec before any planning or code), `debug` (Analyze errors and apply fixes), `doc-coauthoring` (AI-assisted documentation authoring), `mcp-builder` (Build and configure MCP servers), `multi-perspective-review` (Multi-perspective collaborative review of plans or documents), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (4): `backend`, `dev`, `meta`, `planning`\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-code-kit@claude-community` from `This-HW/claude-code-kit` (`plugins/common`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 16,
    "agent": 4,
    "hook": 4
  },
